  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - The proposed two storey side extension and first floor rear extension, on account of its improper design and excessive scale, would result in a bulky and obtrusive form of development that fails to remain subservient to the main house, causing harm to its character and visual appearance, the public streetscene and its surrounding area. This would be contrary to policies CC1 (Context and Character), SC7 (Residential Extensions and Alterations) of the adopted Local Plan (2015) and the intentions of the adopted Residential Extension Guidelines SPD.",
    "Reason : 2 - The applicant has failed to demonstrate that adequate and safe pedestrian and vehicular access and provisions would be retained within the site. This would be contrary to Local Plan policy EC2 'Developing a sustainable local transport network' and the Council's Residential crossover and off-street parking policy."
  ],
